d via training; also B's weak memory for numbers is less critical than A's unorganized behavior. So we keep B.\n\nWe need to output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate B.\n\nLet's craft concise argument referencing prior discussion."}
